        byte[] key = "YOUR_KEY".getBytes("UTF-8");
        byte[] iv = new byte[12];
        SecureRandom random = SecureRandom.getInstance("SHA1PRNG");
        random.nextBytes(iv);
        GCMParameterSpec gcmParameterSpec = new GCMParameterSpec(128, iv);
        Cipher cipher = Cipher.getInstance("GCM/AES/NoPadding");
        cipher.init(Cipher.ENCRYPT_MODE, new SecretKeySpec(key, "AES"), gcmParameterSpec);
        ...
    }
}
```

2. Call the `updateAAD` method before each message encryption or decryption to provide additional authenticated data.

```java
byte[] aad = "ADDITIONAL_AUTHENTICATED_DATA".getBytes("UTF-8");
cipher.updateAAD(aad);
byte[] plaintext = ...;
byte[] ciphertext = cipher.doFinal(plaintext);
...
byte[] aadForDecryption = "SAME_ADDITIONAL_AUTHENTICATED_DATA".getBytes("UTF-8");
cipher.updateAAD(aadForDecryption);
byte[] ciphertextForDecryption = ...;
byte[] plaintextForDecryption = cipher.doFinal(ciphertextForDecryption);
```

In this example, we're using the same additional authenticated data for both encryption and decryption

