Sure! Here's an example of simulating natural selection in MATLAB using a simple genetic model:

First, let's define the genotype and phenotype for our population. We'll use two genes, each with two possible alleles (A or a). The genotype determines the phenotype, which will be either "fit" (representing a favorable trait) or "unfit" (representing an unfavorable trait).

```matlab
% Define genotypes and phenotypes
genes = {'A', 'a'};
alleleFrequency = [0.7, 0.3]; % Frequency of A allele
populationSize = 1000;

